From: Sushil Chandanshive <sushilcs89@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 14:49:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rank fighters by the committee formula; drive the new
 Upcoming Events from the database

Score = (Win% x 0.7 + sum of win method weights x 0.3) x sqrt(total fights),
from finalized results only. Weights are a database table management can edit
from the admin dashboard; rankings recalculate on every change. Rankings page
shows Score instead of ELO.

The Home "Upcoming Events" list and the Events page upcoming bands (added on
5 Oct) are now filled from the database, using the existing markup as the
template. Seed brought up to date for Rising Star 8 and Fight Night 19.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015AUtBHH8bDft2Ejpj9vkH1
